result with Path.startsWith against the base, which should already be absolute and normalised.
Path.startsWith compares whole name elements, so a folder called public-old does not count as inside public.
An absolute name replaces the base when it is resolved, and the startsWith check then rejects it. Use
Path.toRealPath on the base if symbolic links are possible.', 'generated') on conflict (concept_id, language, framework) do update set body = excluded.body;
