InetSocketAddress, and HttpServer.createContext registers a handler for a path prefix. In the handler, add
the Content-Type header to the exchange''s response headers before calling HttpExchange.sendResponseHeaders
with the status and the length. Files.probeContentType can return null, so keep a small map from extension
to type for html, css and js.', 'generated') on conflict (concept_id, language, framework) do update set body = excluded.body;
