subdirectories, so register each one yourself, for example while walking the tree with Files.walkFileTree.
WatchService.take waits for the next batch of events, and WatchKey.reset must be called afterwards or the
key stops delivering. On some platforms the built-in implementation polls, so changes can arrive late.', 'generated') on conflict (concept_id, language, framework) do update set body = excluded.body;
