return out', null, '[{"id":"p1","point":"Deleting a comment that sits between two words with no spaces, such as a type name and a variable name, glues them into one word. Replacing the comment with a single space keeps them apart"},{"id":"p2","point":"A block comment that spans lines is removed together with its line breaks, so code from two lines ends up on one. That shifts line numbers in error messages, and in JavaScript a line break can change meaning, for example right after return, so the line breaks should be kept"}]'::jsonb);
