    return NUMBER(piece)', null, '[{"id":"p1","point":"Lower-casing the word lets True, FALSE or Null through, but JSON keywords are lower case only, so the word must match exactly"},{"id":"p2","point":"The number lexer takes any run of those characters, so pieces such as 1-2, 012 or 1.e5 become numbers"},{"id":"p3","point":"The fix is to follow the number rule in order: an optional minus, a single zero or digits that do not start with zero, then an optional fraction and an optional exponent, each with at least one digit"}]'::jsonb);
