write(conn, text)', null, '[{"id":"p1","point":"When the file does not exist, reading it fails and the client gets no reply at all. Check for the file and send 404 Not Found when it is missing"},{"id":"p2","point":"length of the text counts characters, but Content-Length must count bytes, so a UTF-8 page with accented letters gets the wrong length. Read the file as bytes and send their count"},{"id":"p3","point":"Reading the file as text also breaks images and other binary files, which reading bytes avoids"}]'::jsonb);
